      "last_edit_date": 0,
      "message_parsed": "<blockquote class=\"xfBb-quote\" data-name=\"nemec2000\">- это не работает meta_refresh($url, $time = 5)</blockquote> <br />\nА ни чего что это функция <a href=\"http://code.google.com/p/torrentpier2/source/browse/trunk/upload/includes/functions.php#2022\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">http://code.google.com/p/torrentpier2/source/browse/trunk/upload/includes/functions.php#2022</a> ???<br />\n <br />\nПопробуйте так: meta_refresh(<a href=\"http://wiki.mytracker.org\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">http://wiki.mytracker.org</a>, 5)",
